# m7_identity (track A, M7 engine): the identity check with the pattern engine in flight.
# Endless probe mode from 31 (debug_probe: a hit removes the offender, charges the power loss
# and +80 mercy in the World at once, 60 ticks invulnerable, counted in debug_hits; applied
# in both simulate modes). Input: A at 30, still fire 60..239, then m2_play's sweep (up 40 /
# hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20) to 6599, B held 1500..1519, 3000..3019, 4700..4719 (the
# stage-1 boss fight) and 6000..6029 (loop 1, stage 1 again). debug_spray (a test hook that
# spawns, from (140, 64): 8 turning bullets, 2 orbs that split into 6 pellets whose children
# split again into 3, 3 stop-and-go pellets that re-aim as fans of 3 at age 50, and an
# accelerating needle with a speed cap; it checkpoints the history) at 1400, 2950, 4650 and
# 5950, so splits, re-aims and turns are in flight across each hold (the holds rewind to
# about 40 ticks after the sprays). debug_history_check (0 = the World rebuilt from keyframe +
# input log is identical, field by field) is pinned every 10 updates and on every held frame
# and the two after each release; it was 0 on every frame 32..6599 when this was written.
# The probe counted 8 hits; the boss died at about update 5000 (stage index 4 = loop 1).
--frames 6600 --call-at "31 debug_probe" --call-at "1400 debug_spray" --call-at "2950 debug_spray" --call-at "4650 debug_spray" --call-at "5950 debug_spray" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_hits,debug_rank,debug_stage_index,debug_world_size --at "1500 debug_state == 5" --at "1520 debug_state == 1" --at "3000 debug_state == 5" --at "3020 debug_state == 1" --at "4700 debug_state == 5" --at "4720 debug_state == 1" --at "6000 debug_state == 5" --at "6030 debug_state == 1" --at "40 debug_history_check == 0" --at "50 debug_history_check == 0" --at "60 debug_history_check == 0" --at "70 debug_history_check == 0" --at "80 debug_history_check == 0" --at "90 debug_history_check == 0" --at "100 debug_history_check == 0" --at "110 debug_history_check == 0" --at "120 debug_history_check == 0" --at "130 debug_history_check == 0" --at "140 debug_history_check == 0" --at "150 debug_history_check == 0" --at "160 debug_history_check == 0" --at "170 debug_history_check == 0" --at "180 debug_history_check == 0" --at "190 debug_history_check == 0" --at "200 debug_history_check == 0" --at "210 debug_history_check == 0" --at "220 debug_history_check == 0" --at "230 debug_history_check == 0" --at "240 debug_history_check == 0" --at "250 debug_history_check == 0" --at "260 debug_history_check == 0" --at "270 debug_history_check == 0" --at "280 debug_history_check == 0" --at "290 debug_history_check == 0" --at "300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "310 debug_history_check == 0" --at "320 debug_history_check == 0" --at "330 debug_history_check == 0" --at "340 debug_history_check == 0" --at "350 debug_history_check == 0" --at "360 debug_history_check == 0" --at "370 debug_history_check == 0" --at "380 debug_history_check == 0" --at "390 debug_history_check == 0" --at "400 debug_history_check == 0" --at "410 debug_history_check == 0" --at "420 debug_history_check == 0" --at "430 debug_history_check == 0" --at "440 debug_history_check == 0" --at "450 debug_history_check == 0" --at "460 debug_histo